		{"id":"357f3dde9e821856","type":"text","text":"Heightfield based terrains:\n* https://www.sidefx.com/community-main-menu/complete-a-z-terrain-handbook/\n* https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/model/heightfields.html\n* https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/model/terrain_workflow.html\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/create-terrains-from-elevation-maps/\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/foundations-terrain/","x":13721,"y":1497,"width":737,"height":223},
		{"id":"9f4967905224c489","type":"file","file":"Images/Noise/FurtherLearning/Water.jpg","x":13723,"y":405,"width":732,"height":412},
		{"id":"15821614df0faa46","type":"text","text":"Goal: \"I need desert biome terrain for 3rd person RPG Console game\"","x":-14731,"y":1973,"width":680,"height":67},
		{"id":"f471243db33f445f","type":"text","text":"Gather requirements for your idea and analyze references:\n* Topology/Geometry of terrain (e.g., hills, valleys, etc.)\n* Material (e.g., snow, sand, grass, etc.)\n* Props (e.g., trees, rocks, etc.)","x":-13925,"y":1975,"width":518,"height":172},
		{"id":"5bcbd7c0705c0064","type":"file","file":"Images/Noise/Workflow/mateusz-michalski-desert-temple-fin2.jpg","x":-14731,"y":2147,"width":679,"height":326},
		{"id":"68d98af29d062d51","type":"text","text":"Reference","x":-14731,"y":2087,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e879caa00296a777","type":"file","file":"Images/Noise/LectureExamples/3/MeshNoiseDisplacement_Step5.jpg","x":-16078,"y":2631,"width":945,"height":422},
