		{"id":"b75e12062ad42ca4","type":"text","text":"Topology and color processing:\n* https://qgis.org/\n* https://dwtkns.com/srtm30m/\n* https://earthexplorer.usgs.gov/\n* https://visibleearth.nasa.gov/\n* https://www.motionforgepictures.com/height-maps/\n* https://www.copernicus.eu/en/access-data\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AGczLhQg8yI\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cfXTfSY1agk","x":16465,"y":-441,"width":648,"height":320},
		{"id":"aebb726ad38dfd0f","type":"text","text":"Worldbuilding:\n* https://www.cs.princeton.edu/courses/archive/fall16/cos526/papers/smelik14.pdf\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ToCozpl1sYY\n* https://www.youtube.com/@Gdconf/playlists\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/project-pegasus-roads-tracks-and-rivers/","x":17228,"y":464,"width":407,"height":316},
		{"id":"288242cb02af3188","type":"file","file":"Images/Noise/FurtherLearning/WorldBuilding.jpg","x":17680,"y":427,"width":976,"height":390},
		{"id":"ce14969a6e8c992d","type":"text","text":"More examples:\n*  https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/green-mountains-terrain-overview/\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/procedural-desert/\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/terrain-nodebook/\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/scattering-randomized-geometry-over-terrain/\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/project-pegasus-create-a-landscape-color-map/\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/epic-environments-made-easy/","x":17738,"y":-259,"width":702,"height":266},
		{"id":"028af4c85c2524ff","type":"text","text":"Mesh-based terrains:\n* https://entagma.com/houdini-game-tools-assembling-a-3d-scan-of-the-earth/\n* https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/procedurally-generating-and-rendering-lowpoly-terrain/\n* https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MRNFcywkUSA&list=PLFt_AvWsXl0eBW2EiBtl_sxmDtSgZBxB3&index=3","x":16790,"y":1369,"width":860,"height":256},
